        "filing_date": "2026-04-15",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also maintain a written business continuity plan, which was developed using the guidelines published by the National Institute of Standards of Technology, to minimize the risk of data loss due to any interruption in business.",
